WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:00.895
[JOHN] Hi, there. This is John Green.

00:00:00.995 --> 00:00:01.859
[HANK] And I'm Hank Green,

00:00:01.959 --> 00:00:04.105
and we are the Vlogbrothers on YouTube.

00:00:04.205 --> 00:00:05.850
[JOHN] And we are making this video

00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:10.459
a Frequently Asked Questions video
for the purposes of answering some questions

00:00:10.559 --> 00:00:11.205
that are frequently asked.

00:00:11.305 --> 00:00:12.950
[HANK] People are often confused.

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:14.585
Like, for example, what is a Nerdfighter?

00:00:14.685 --> 00:00:15.919
[JOHN] A Nerdfighter is a person who,

00:00:16.019 --> 00:00:19.119
instead of being made out of, like,
bones and skin and tissue,

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:20.909
is made entirely of awesome.

00:00:21.009 --> 00:00:21.999
[HANK] So what you're saying is that

00:00:22.099 --> 00:00:23.669
Nerdfighters don't fight nerds?

00:00:23.769 --> 00:00:26.039
[JOHN] No, we're clearly... pro-nerd.

00:00:26.139 --> 00:00:28.789
[HANK] Nerdfighter is basically just
the community that sprung up around our videos,

00:00:28.789 --> 00:00:30.829
and, basically, we just get together
and try to do awesome things

00:00:30.929 --> 00:00:32.960
and have a good time 
and fight against World Suck.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:33.790
[JOHN] What's World Suck?

00:00:33.890 --> 00:00:35.120
[HANK] World Suck is kind of exactly

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.260
what World Suck sounds like.
It's hard to quantify exactly, but, you know,

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:39.920
it's, like, the amount 
of suck in the world.

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:41.640
[JOHN] One of the questions 
we get asked the most is:

00:00:41.740 --> 00:00:42.870
"Do you guys have real jobs?"

00:00:43.770 --> 00:00:44.700
[HANK] Yes!

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.610
[JOHN] Well, I mean, it depends on how you
define "real".

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:49.200
Hank runs the environmental technology website
EcoGeek.

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.790
[HANK] John Green is an award-winning author.

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:53.180
He has written books such as Looking For Alaska,

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.570
An Abundance of Katherines, and Paper Towns,
and he's won many awards including

00:00:56.670 --> 00:00:59.950
the Edgar Award and the,
the Printz Award.

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:01.495
[HANK] Why don't you blink?

00:01:01.595 --> 00:01:03.040
[JOHN] I don't blink because I'm focusing

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:04.169
when I'm in front of the camera.

00:01:04.269 --> 00:01:06.859
I do blink in real life.
That's why I still have eyes.

00:01:06.959 --> 00:01:10.770
And, also, it's sort of a tribute to the original
video blogger,

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:11.560
our hero,

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:12.350
zefrank.

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:14.940
[JOHN] So, Hank, what's DFTBA?

00:01:15.040 --> 00:01:16.530
[HANK] DFTBA is an acronym.

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:18.349
[JOHN] No, it isn't!
It is not an acronym.

00:01:18.449 --> 00:01:21.309
Acronyms are pronounceable. It is an initialism.

00:01:22.009 --> 00:01:23.369
[HANK trying to pronounce DFTBA] Dfft-tpuh...

00:01:23.469 --> 00:01:25.029
[JOHN] Dfft-buh.
[BOTH laugh]

00:01:25.129 --> 00:01:27.389
[HANK] Okay. It's an initialism 
that stands for

00:01:27.489 --> 00:01:28.974
Don't Forget To Be Awesome.

00:01:29.074 --> 00:01:29.959
[JOHN] Am I too young...

00:01:30.059 --> 00:01:30.679
[HANK] ...old...
[JOHN] ...fat...

00:01:30.779 --> 00:01:31.309
[HANK] ...skinny...
[JOHN] ...weird...

00:01:31.409 --> 00:01:32.839
[HANK] ...cool...
[JOHN] ...nerdy...

00:01:32.939 --> 00:01:33.369
[HANK] ...handsome...
[JOHN] ...tall...

00:01:33.369 --> 00:01:34.859
[HANK] ...dead...
[BOTH] ...to be a Nerdfighter?

00:01:34.859 --> 00:01:37.280
[JOHN] No!
If you wanna be a Nerdfighter,

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:38.555
you ARE a Nerdfighter!

00:01:38.655 --> 00:01:40.729
[HANK] Nerdfighter dictionary time!

00:01:40.829 --> 00:01:41.834
[JOHN] Lightning round.

00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:43.039
[HANK] Puppy-sized elephants.

00:01:43.139 --> 00:01:45.349
[JOHN] We asked natural selection
to make us puppy-sized elephants,

00:01:45.449 --> 00:01:47.170
because they would have 
the evolutionary advantage

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:49.990
of being adorable, and we are waiting for
that to happen.

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:50.870
[JOHN] Stuff on heads?

00:01:50.970 --> 00:01:54.069
[HANK] Yeah, if you put stuff on your head,
it makes you feel better about life.

00:01:54.169 --> 00:01:55.230
[JOHN] Nerdfighter gatherings?

00:01:55.330 --> 00:01:56.390
[HANK] Is when Nerdfighters get together.

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:57.925
Sometimes we're there, sometimes we're not.

00:01:58.025 --> 00:01:59.359
[JOHN] French the llama?

00:01:59.459 --> 00:02:02.649
[HANK] French the llama is something that
John is trying to make into a thing,

00:02:02.749 --> 00:02:06.090
in which people say [for example], 
"French the llama, that whale is big",

00:02:06.190 --> 00:02:07.295
but it's not gonna work.

00:02:07.395 --> 00:02:08.100
[JOHN] Oh, it's gonna happen!

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:09.815
I'm gonna make french the llama happen!

00:02:09.915 --> 00:02:10.830
[HANK] Puff levels?

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:14.630
[JOHN] Uh, my puff level is the level of puff
in my hair,

00:02:14.730 --> 00:02:16.525
which gets higher as I get more stressed out.

00:02:16.625 --> 00:02:17.320
[HANK] Decepticon?

00:02:17.420 --> 00:02:18.650
[JOHN] Is the opposite of a Nerdfighter.

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:19.580
[JOHN] Giant squid of anger?

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:22.800
[HANK] Is basically like a YouTube troll.
[Makes angry squid noises]

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:23.785
[JOHN] Tiny chicken disease?

00:02:23.885 --> 00:02:24.870
[HANK] Is a disease that happens when

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:28.740
there's tiny chickens in your head and they lay eggs and all of it gooes out of your nose.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:29.700
It's actually...

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:30.650
[JOHN] It's a common cold.
[HANK] Yeah.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:31.550
[JOHN] Secret siblings?

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:32.750
[HANK] Secret siblings are anyone who makes

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:35.130
video responses down here to our videos.

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:37.410
[JOHN] Down here, in my pants.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:38.255
[HANK] In your pants?

00:02:38.355 --> 00:02:41.700
[JOHN] "In your pants" is a phenomenon
discovered by Maureen Johnson.

00:02:41.875 --> 00:02:43.850
If you add "in your pants" to the end of book titles,

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:46.140
those book titles become much funnier.

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:48.095
"The Sun Also Rises... In Your Pants"

00:02:48.195 --> 00:02:50.550
[HANK] "A Spot of Bother... In Your Pants"

00:02:50.650 --> 00:02:51.335
[JOHN] Notsome?

00:02:51.435 --> 00:02:52.920
[HANK] Notsome is the opposite of awesome.

00:02:53.020 --> 00:02:55.170
See also Fail Puppy and the Fail Boat.

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:56.320
[HANK] The Yeti?

00:02:56.420 --> 00:02:57.790
[JOHN] Is my wife. The Katherine...

00:02:57.890 --> 00:02:59.060
[HANK] ...is my wife.

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.515
[JOHN] Oh, and this...

00:03:00.615 --> 00:03:03.270
[HANK] Ah... is the Nerdfighter gang sign.

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.580
So, if you see somebody doing this, 
you know not to shoot them.

00:03:06.680 --> 00:03:08.600
[JOHN] We have created a playlist of twenty
Vlogbrothers videos

00:03:08.700 --> 00:03:10.890
that you can watch 
that will give you a broader sense of

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:13.390
what's going on in Nerdfighteria, in case
you're new.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:15.400
[HANK] And if you have any friends
that are a little bit confused about why

00:03:15.500 --> 00:03:17.810
you're watching two nerds make videos 
about Star Wars

00:03:17.910 --> 00:03:20.090
and giraffe love and 
making the world a better place

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:21.345
through video...

00:03:21.445 --> 00:03:23.100
[JOHN] Those, those are three 
interconnected ideas.

00:03:23.200 --> 00:03:23.630
[HANK laughs]

00:03:23.730 --> 00:03:25.160
[HANK] ...then you can send them to this video
right here

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:30.830
so that they can get a little bit of a debrief
before plunging in to the rest of our... stuff.

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:34.220
[JOHN] Now, the playlist is on the screen
and we gotta do like a little playlist song.

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:35.500
[BOTH singing] Woo!
[HANK] Playlist song, playlist song!

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:38.200
Bwoo-bwoo-bwoo!
Playlist song, playlist song!

00:03:38.300 --> 00:03:39.535
Boop-bwoo bwoo-bwoo!

00:03:39.635 --> 00:03:40.870
[JOHN speaking] Now, did you just write that?

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:43.470
Because that's really good.
That's brilliant.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:45.110
Did you, like, did you come up with that
off the top of your head like that?

00:03:45.210 --> 00:03:47.010
[HANK singing] Bwoo!
[BOTH laugh]

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:49.700
[HANK] It's like Mario swimming. 
[Singing] Bwoo-bwoo-bwoo!

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:52.260
[JOHN] Nerdfighteria, thanks for being awesome
and thanks for all the support you've given us

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:55.290
as we continue into our fourth year 
of making videos.

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:57.130
Best wishes!

00:03:57.230 --> 00:04:02.130
[HANK] DFTBA!

